{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","风雷骤怒"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","風雷の怒り"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤风暴持续击飞所有敌人，并持续激发“风雷晶瞳”对敌人造成真实伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","嵐を召喚し、敵全体を持続的に打ち上げ、「風雷の瞳」で確定ダメージを与える"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","卓琳飞入高空，召唤持续4秒的风暴立即对所有敌人造成其30% + 3%生命值的伤害（不超过自身500% + 50%攻击力），风暴期间持续击飞所有敌人并使其远程防御降低20点，并且每秒激发2次“风雷晶瞳”召唤落雷攻击所有敌人造成110% + 15% ATK真实伤害，激发间隔受自身急速属性影响且每秒最多激发8次。卓琳技能期间处于无敌状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","空高く飛び上がり、4秒間、嵐を召喚し続ける。嵐召喚時、直ちに敵全体にそれぞれHP上限×30% + 3%のダメージを与える（ジョリーンの攻撃力×500% + 50%を超えない）。嵐の期間中、持続的に敵全体を打ち上げ、対象の遠距離防御-20。さらに、毎秒「風雷の瞳」を2回発動し、1回ごとに落雷で敵全体を攻撃し、110% + 15% ATKの確定ダメージを与える。「風雷の瞳」の発動間隔は自身の速度の影響を受け、毎秒最大8回まで発動可能。スキル発動中、自身は無敵状態になる"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":50,"end":56,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":116,"end":122,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":46,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":75,"end":81,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":158,"end":164,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":112,"end":126,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":162,"end":164,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":154,"end":168,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":227,"end":229,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","该技能激发“风雷晶瞳”造成的伤害提高至120% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「風雷の瞳」による落雷のダメージが120% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","该技能激发“风雷晶瞳”造成的伤害提高至130% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","「風雷の瞳」による落雷のダメージが130% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","该技能激发“风雷晶瞳”造成的伤害提高至140% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","「風雷の瞳」による落雷のダメージが140% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","该技能激发“风雷晶瞳”造成的伤害提高至150% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","「風雷の瞳」による落雷のダメージが150% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","疾风汹涌"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","疾風怒濤"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","卓琳受到的急速属性增益提高。主动释放时在一段时间内持续激发“风雷晶瞳”对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身が味方から受ける速度バフ効果UP。アクティブ効果：一定時間の間、「風雷の瞳」を操作し続け、敵に範囲ダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，卓琳受到来自友军施加的急速属性增益效果提高100%且不会因增益消失而失去急速，但相同增益效果提供的急速属性增益不会叠加。\n主动释放时，卓琳控制“风雷晶瞳”持续2秒，每秒激发2次“风雷晶瞳”在敌人所在位置召唤小型气流（按照从前至后的顺序优先选择不同敌人），对目标周围1格范围内的敌人造成110% + 15% ATK伤害，激发间隔受自身急速属性影响且每秒最多激发8次。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：味方から受ける速度バフ効果+100%、速度上昇効果はバフ消失後も持続する。同じ速度上昇効果は重複しない（スタック可能な効果は最大スタック数まで重複可能）\nアクティブ効果：2秒間、「風雷の瞳」を操作し続ける。毎秒「風雷の瞳」を2回発動し、1回ごとに敵の位置に小型旋風を1つ召喚（前から後ろへの順に異なる敵を優先的に選択）。小型旋風は、対象とその周囲1マス以内の敵に110% + 15% ATKのダメージを与える。「風雷の瞳」の発動間隔は自身の速度の影響を受け、毎秒最大8回まで発動可能"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":150,"end":156,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":192,"end":198,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":146,"end":160,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":188,"end":202,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","该技能激发“风雷晶瞳”造成的伤害提高至115% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「風雷の瞳」による小型旋風のダメージが115% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":19,"e